{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-11-04T09:17:59.281299196Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"```json\n{\"plans\":{\"sufficient\":{\"assertions\":[\"Northport council voted on the bridge plan on 1 June 2024.\",\"The vote result on that date was seven votes in approval and two against.\"],\"questions\":[\"Do minutes or official records of Northport council show a bridge plan vote on 1 June 2024?\",\"What was the recorded vote tally for the bridge plan at that meeting?\",\"Did any council member abstain or was the vote recorded differently in other accounts?\"]},\"insufficient\":{\"assertions\":[\"Mayor Imani made a statement about Eastport unemployment between 2022 and 2023.\",\"The quoted content was that Eastport unemployment fell by 20 percent between 2022 and 2023.\"],\"questions\":[\"Did Mayor Imani actually make this statement, and where and when was it reported?\",\"What do independent labor statistics show about Eastport unemployment levels in 2022 and 2023?\",\"Does any measurement show a 20 percent change, and does it match the direction (fall) stated?\"]},\"conflicting\":{\"assertions\":[\"An independent measurement of median delivery time in Westport existed for 2023.\",\"The disputed proposition is that this 2023 median delivery time was less than 30 minutes.\"],\"questions\":[\"What methodology and source produced the independent measurement of Westport delivery times in 2023?\",\"What was the reported median delivery time value in 2023?\",\"Do other independent measurements or records for Westport 2023 show a different median?\"]},\"shared\":{\"assertions\":[\"A new signal system was introduced in Southport in 2024.\",\"The causal claim is that this system reduced junction delays by 15 percent in 2024 compared with 2023.\"],\"questions\":[\"What measurements of junction delays exist for Southport in 2023 and 2024, and what were the values?\",\"When exactly was the signal system installed, and what other changes (traffic volume, roadworks, seasonality) occurred between 2023 and 2024?\",\"Do studies or official reports attribute the delay change to the signal system specifically versus alternative explanations?\"]},\"train-1225\":{\"assertions\":[\"Mike Bloomberg is identified as a former mayor of New York, US.\",\"The claim compares Bloomberg's wealth to that of the bottom 125 million Americans, with reference context of 19 February 2020.\"],\"questions\":[\"What estimates of Mike Bloomberg's net worth existed around 19 February 2020?\",\"What estimates of the combined wealth of the bottom 125 million Americans existed for the same period?\",\"Was Bloomberg a former mayor of New York at that time, and is the wealth comparison supported by cited wealth data sources?\"]}}}\n```","thinking":"Produce JSON plans."},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":2935852243,"prompt_eval_count":526,"prompt_eval_cached_count":0,"eval_count":559}
